mermaid.decision:
flowchart TD
  Need[Work to run] --> Q1{Must the user wait for the result?}
  Q1 -->|Yes short| Sync[Synchronous Apex in this request]
  Q1 -->|Long callout or later| Async[Async Apex: prefer Queueable]
  Sync --> Q2{DML must be atomic?}
  Q2 -->|Yes| Tx[One Apex transaction; errors roll back]
  Async --> Q3{Click transaction rolled back?}
  Q3 -->|Yes| Drop[Queued future jobs are not processed]
  Tx --> Q4{Client may retry?}
  Q4 -->|Yes| Idem[Idempotency key or External Id upsert]
  Q4 -->|No unique key| Risk[Duplicate rows on double-click]
